    - File not found: shared/axiom_utils/_smoke_result.json\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 41 | 1 | Shared utils smoke test: import axiom_utils and write result | Axiom I | 23 |\n| 40 | 1 | Agency Analyzer (shim) runner: import v1.2 and write report | Axiom I | 23 |\n| 37 | 1 | Agency Analyzer V2.1 Runner: import v1.2 and write report | Axiom I | 22 |\n| 36 | 1 | Agency Actions v1.2: add recursion/persistence/emergence/collab metrics | Axiom I | 22 |\n| 31 | 1 | Agency Analyzer V2 Runner (fixed shim): import v1.1 and write report | Axiom I | 20 |\n| 28 | 1 | Agency Analyzer V2 Runner: import v1.1 actions and write report | Axiom I | 19 |\n| 27 | 1 | Agency Actions\
    \ v1.1: schema-aligned with ticks and standardized analyze types | Axiom I | 19 |\n| 23 | 1 | Agency Adapter Runner v1: analyze exported actions (no-visualization) | Axiom I | 17 |\n| 18 | 1 | Agency Adapter v1: export RNG runs to shared actions | Axiom I | 16 |\n| 16 | 1 | RNG Demo v5: JB normality p-values per seed + aggregated | Axiom I | 15 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**shared/agency_lab/analyses:**\n- analyzer_state_v2_fixed.json\n- axiom_report_v1_1_fixed.txt\n- axiom_report_v1_2_fixed.txt\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agency_lab/analyses/axiom_report_v1_2_fixed.txt:**\n```\n============================================================\nAGENCY ANALYSIS REPORT (Shim v2_fixed)\n============================================================\nGenerated:\
    \ 2025-10-22T14:36:55Z\n\nGLOBAL SUMMARY\n- agents: 8\n- actions: 18\n- action_type_distribution: {'generate': 5, 'analyze': 13}\n- autonomy_mean: 0.6693609377704336\n- diversity_mean: 0.573934896284056\n\nPATTERN SUMMARIES\n- convergence: 0.943443\n- specialization: 0.056557\n- coordination: 1.000000\n\nPER-AGENT METRICS\n* axiom_aggregator_v2: actions=1, uniq_types=1, diversity=-0.000000, create_ratio=0.500000, autonomy=0.200000\n* axiom_aggregator_v4: actions=1, uniq_types=1, diversity=-0.000000, create_ratio=0.500000, autonomy=0.200000\n* axiom_aggregator_v5: actions=1, uniq_types=1, diversity=-0.000000, create_ratio=0.500000, autonomy=0.200000\n* axiom_rng_seed_0: actions=3, uniq_types=2, diversity=0.918296, create_ratio=1.000000, autonomy=0.950978\n* axiom_rng_seed_1: actions=3, uniq_types=2, diversity=0.918296, create_ratio=1.000000, autonomy=0.950978\n* axiom_rng_seed_2: actions=3, uniq_types=2, diversity=0.918296, create_ratio=1.000000, autonomy=0.950978\n* axiom_rng_seed_3:\
