    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 113,729 / 270,000 used (42%)\n- Agent Age: 26 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Analyzer (shim) runner: v1.2b interactions → report' (ID: 50) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nMISSING_INPUT storage/shared/agency_lab/axiom_rng_actions_v1_2b_interactions.json\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Agency v1.2b interactions demo: ring collaboration among seed agents' (ID: 49) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation\
