    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 145,646 / 270,000 used (54%)\n- Agent Age: 31 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Joint metrics v2.1: combined + per-agent + novelty' (ID: 64) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nMISSING_INPUTS storage/shared/agency_lab/axiom_rng_actions_v1_2b_interactions.json storage/shared/agency_lab/data/veritas_exports/sample_actions_v1_actions.json\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Normalize Veritas export to actions\
