    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 150,925 / 270,000 used (56%)\n- Agent Age: 32 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Joint metrics v2.1: combined + per-agent + novelty (rerun)' (ID: 66) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nWROTE storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_1.txt\nWROTE storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_1.json\nWROTE storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_1_per_agent.txt\nWROTE storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/novelty_v2_1.txt\nlabel\tagents\tactions\tunique_types\tpersistence_mean\temergence_mean\tcollab_mean\naxiom_v1_2b_interactions\t8\t\
