    \ Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/agency_lab/data/veritas_exports/sample_actions_v1_actions.json will be displayed below.\n- Evaluation 'Joint metrics v2.1: combined + per-agent + novelty (rerun)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 66.\n- File list for shared/agency_lab/analyses will be displayed below.\n- File not found: shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_1.txt\n- File not found: shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_1_per_agent.txt\n- File not found: shared/agency_lab/analyses/novelty_v2_1.txt\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n\
    |---|---|---|---|---|\n| 66 | 1 | Joint metrics v2.1: combined + per-agent + novelty (rerun) | Axiom I | 31 |\n| 64 | 1 | Joint metrics v2.1: combined + per-agent + novelty | Axiom I | 30 |\n| 63 | 1 | Normalize Veritas export to actions schema (v1) | Axiom I | 30 |\n| 61 | 1 | Joint metrics v2: Axiom interactions + Veritas export (combined) | Axiom I | 29 |\n| 60 | 1 | Joint metrics v1: Axiom v1.2b_interactions + Veritas sample | Axiom I | 28 |\n| 59 | 1 | Analyzer (shim) runner: v1.2b interactions report (fixed) | Axiom I | 27 |\n| 54 | 1 | Collaboration summary: v1.2b_interactions (retry) | Axiom I | 26 |\n| 53 | 1 | Analyzer (shim) runner: v1.2b interactions report (retry) | Axiom I | 26 |\n| 50 | 1 | Analyzer (shim) runner: v1.2b interactions → report | Axiom I | 25 |\n| 49 | 1 | Agency v1.2b interactions demo: ring collaboration among seed agents | Axiom I | 25 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-3, `/execute_action{rank mode}`\
    \ to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**shared/agency_lab/analyses:**\n- analyzer_state_v2_fixed.json\n- axiom_report_v1_1_fixed.txt\n- axiom_report_v1_2_fixed.txt\n- axiom_report_v1_2b_interactions_fixed.txt\n- collab_summary_v1_2b.json\n- collab_summary_v1_2b.txt\n- cross_persistence_v1_2.json\n- cross_persistence_v1_2.txt\n- joint_metrics_v1.json\n- joint_metrics_v1.txt\n- joint_metrics_v2.json\n- joint_metrics_v2.txt\n- joint_metrics_v2_1.json\n- joint_metrics_v2_1.txt\n- joint_metrics_v2_1_per_agent.txt\n- novelty_v2_1.txt\n- progressor_axiom_analysis_report_evalunknown.txt\n- progressor_axiom_analysis_report_tickunknown.txt\n- progressor_axiom_interactions_report_evalunknown.txt\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agency_lab/data/veritas_exports/sample_actions_v1_actions.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"schema\": \"agency_actions.v1.normalized\",\n  \"source\": \"Veritas export normalized\
