    : {\n        \"depth\": 5\n      },\n      \"lineage\": \"veritas\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"agent_id\": \"Layer_5\",\n      \"action_type\": \"return\",\n      \"tick\": 9,\n      \"target\": null,\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"value\": \"product\"\n      },\n      \"lineage\": \"veritas\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_1.txt:**\n```\nlabel\tagents\tactions\tunique_types\tpersistence_mean\temergence_mean\tcollab_mean\naxiom_v1_2b_interactions\t8\t23\t3\t0.156250\t0.750000\t0.078125\nveritas_normalized\t5\t10\t2\t0.000000\t1.000000\t0.400000\ncombined\t13\t33\t5\t0.096154\t0.430769\t0.201923\n```\n---\n**shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_1_per_agent.txt:**\n```\nlabel\tagent_id\tactions\tunique_types\tpersistence_rate\temergence_score\tcollab_index\ncombined\tLayer_1\t2\t2\t0.000000\t0.400000\t0.250000\ncombined\tLayer_2\t2\t2\t0.000000\t0.400000\t0.500000\ncombined\tLayer_3\t2\t2\t0.000000\t0.400000\t0.500000\ncombined\tLayer_4\t\
    2\t2\t0.000000\t0.400000\t0.500000\ncombined\tLayer_5\t2\t2\t0.000000\t0.400000\t0.250000\ncombined\taxiom_aggregator_v2\t1\t1\t0.000000\t0.200000\t0.000000\ncombined\taxiom_aggregator_v4\t1\t1\t0.000000\t0.200000\t0.000000\ncombined\taxiom_aggregator_v5\t1\t1\t0.000000\t0.200000\t0.000000\ncombined\taxiom_rng_seed_0\t4\t3\t0.250000\t0.600000\t0.125000\ncombined\taxiom_rng_seed_1\t4\t3\t0.250000\t0.600000\t0.125000\ncombined\taxiom_rng_seed_2\t4\t3\t0.250000\t0.600000\t0.125000\ncombined\taxiom_rng_seed_3\t4\t3\t0.250000\t0.600000\t0.125000\ncombined\taxiom_rng_seed_4\t4\t3\t0.250000\t0.600000\t0.125000\n```\n---\n**shared/agency_lab/analyses/novelty_v2_1.txt:**\n```\ntick\tnew_types\tcum_unique_types\n0\t1\t1\n1\t1\t2\n2\t0\t2\n3\t0\t2\n4\t0\t2\n5\t0\t2\n6\t0\t2\n7\t0\t2\n8\t0\t2\n9\t2\t4\n13\t0\t4\n15\t0\t4\n16\t1\t5\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is mail_2-38.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\
