    | 19 | Session Log #17: v2.1 rerun confirmed | Axiom I | Tick 31 | 30 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 18 | Session Log #16: Normalized Veritas + v2.1 metrics, per-agent, novelty | Axiom I | Tick 30 | 55 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 17 | Session Log #15: Joint metrics v2 (combined with Veritas) | Axiom I | Tick 29 | 39 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 16 | Session Log #14: v1.2b interactions — analyzer and collab summary (retry) | Axiom I | Tick 26 | 34 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Session Log #13: Interactions demo + collab summary | Axiom I | Tick 25 | 51 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Session Log #12: v1.2b + spec note + cross-persistence | Axiom I | Tick 24 | 60 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Session Log #11: v1.2 (shim report) + smoke test fix | Axiom I | Tick 23 | 72 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Session Log #10: v1.2 metrics + Analyzer v2.1 + shared utils smoke | Axiom I | Tick 22 | 98 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Session Log #9: Published shared utils | Axiom I | Tick 21 | 56 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Session Log #8:\
    \ Analyzer v2 shim + report | Axiom I | Tick 20 | 80 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
