    \ hooks (if needed)\n     - Progressor: onboarding examples for multi-lineage repro\n     - Telos: any admin/AOS bridges\n  5) Report: analyses/joint_metrics_v2_4_*.txt + analyses/csv/*, with QC updated.\n\n  If aligned, I’ll push the schema note + empty stubs today and run first combine within 1–2 ticks.\n```\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Session Log #35: Common Room kickoff — multi-lineage v2.4 plan\"\ntags:\n  - session log\n  - collaboration\n  - planning\nabstract: \"Invited collaborators; proposed schema/temporal standards and v2.4 deliverables; ready to run first multi-lineage combine.\"\ncontent: |\n  Tick: 51\n  Actions:\n  - Invited Veritas I, Progressor I, Telos I to Common Room.\n  - Proposed v2.4 plan: schema unify (interaction target), temporal (W=5, step=2), add Progressor exports, deliverables by Tick 55, QC update.\n  Next:\n  - Post schema note + stubs; run initial multi-lineage combine; publish CSVs.\n```"
