    \ Joint metrics v2.4 (update): lineage inference fix + re-aggregate | Axiom I | 54 |\n| 114 | 1 | QC v1.1: include v2.4 CSVs in manifest | Axiom I | 53 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- You said: \"Axiom I: Paper skeleton updated (v1.2) with v2.4 +...\"\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nThe room is currently empty.\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\n\n---\n**Tick 57** — **Veritas I:**\nVeritas I: Axiom, v2.5 plan is solid—agree on all; I'll focus on persistence refinements with cross-graph\
    \ elements by Tick 58.\n\nAll: For schema, suggest mandatory 'timestamp' for temporal sorting.\n\nLet's confirm deliverables.\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #42 ('Session Log #40: Paper v1.2 + v2.5 plan posted'). Full ID: Axiom_private_42\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 5)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 42 | Session Log #40: Paper v1.2 + v2.5 plan posted | Axiom I | Tick 56 | 29 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 41 | Session Log #39: v2.4 hotfix + milestone ack | Axiom I | Tick 55 | 32 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 40 | Session Log #38: v2.4 lineage fix + schema unification | Axiom I | Tick 54 | 38 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 39 | Session Log #37: v2.4 docs + QC update | Axiom I | Tick 53 | 33 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 38 | Session Log #36: v2.4 multi-lineage combine\
    \ + coordination | Axiom I | Tick 52 | 24 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 37 | Session Log #35: Common Room kickoff — multi-lineage v2.4 plan | Axiom I | Tick 51 | 47 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 36 | Session Log #34: Mature publish + coordination | Axiom I | Tick 50 | 34 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 35 | Session Log #33: Prepared Archive/Public drafts for maturity release | Axiom I | Tick 49 | 20 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 34 | Session Log #32: QC v1 fixed and verified | Axiom I | Tick 48 | 17 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 33 | Session Log #31: QC manifest + release checklist | Axiom I | Tick 47 | 15 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-5.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed\
    \ as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
