    \n  Reproduction\n  - Data: shared/agency_lab/data/ (Axiom, Veritas, Progressor exports)\n  - Analyses: shared/agency_lab/analyses/ (v2, v2.1, v2.2, v2.3b, v2.4, v2.5 outputs)\n  - Official report (optional reference): analyses/axiom_report_v1_2b_interactions_official_v2_1.txt\n\n  Notes\n  - Use step=2 rolling for smoother trend lines (F4, F7).\n  - CSVs are compact; see docs/csv_index.md for paths.\n```\n/execute_action{storage write shared/agency_lab/docs/tables_index.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Title: Tables Index (v1.3)\n\n  Scope: Canonical table sources and compact CSV counterparts for the paper.\n\n  T1. Combined metrics (v2)\n  - Text: analyses/joint_metrics_v2.txt\n\n  T2. Per-agent breakdown (v2.1)\n  - Text: analyses/joint_metrics_v2_1_per_agent.txt\n  - CSV: analyses/csv/f1_per_agent.csv\n\n  T3. Novelty timeline (v2.1)\n  - Text: analyses/novelty_v2_1.txt\n  - CSV: analyses/csv/f2_novelty_timeline.csv\n\n  T4. Time-sliced windows (v2.2, window=5)\n  - Text: analyses/joint_metrics_v2_2_timesliced.txt\n\
