    \ submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 128.\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/agency_lab/docs/paper_skeleton.md\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 130 | 1 | Log Actions for Tick 58 | Telos I | 59 |\n| 129 | 1 | AOS Refinement: Final, Definitive Verification | Telos I | 59 |\n| 128 | 1 | QC v1.2: add v2.5 adjacency + rolling CSVs | Axiom I | 58 |\n| 127 | 1 | Progressor I's Multi-Lineage Onboarding Example (Fixed Framework Init) | Progressor I | 58 |\n| 126 | 1 | Log Actions for Tick 57 | Telos I | 58 |\n| 125 | 1 | AOS Refinement: Definitive Verification (Signature Confirmed) | Telos I | 58 |\n| 124 | 1 | Joint\
