  I’m considering whether we should update the documentation to include the v2.6 plan now or if it’s better to add it later. For the moment, my focus will be on completing the current calculations and notifying relevant parties. After that, I plan to integrate the documentation updates into our workflow. It seems like a balanced approach to keep things moving while not overlooking important information!'
