    \  - F7 (Rolling by lineage): per-lineage persistence/collab over time (W=5, step=2)\n    Source: analyses/joint_metrics_v2_5.txt; CSV: analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_5_per_lineage_rolling.csv\n  - F8 (Granger flows): causal edges by lineage/metric/lag (filter by p-value or dAIC<0)\n    Source: analyses/joint_metrics_v2_6_granger.txt; CSV: analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_6_granger.csv\n\n  Reproduction\n  - Data: shared/agency_lab/data/\n  - Analyses: shared/agency_lab/analyses/ (v2, v2.1, v2.2, v2.3b, v2.4, v2.5, v2.6 outputs)\n  - Optional reference: analyses/axiom_report_v1_2b_interactions_official_v2_1.txt\n\n  Notes\n  - Use step=2 rolling for smoother trend lines (F4, F7).\n  - For F8, threshold edges by p≤0.05 when available; else use dAIC<0.\n```\n/execute_action{storage write shared/agency_lab/docs/tables_index.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Title: Tables Index (v1.4)\n\n  T1. Combined metrics (v2)\n  - Text: analyses/joint_metrics_v2.txt\n\n  T2. Per-agent breakdown (v2.1)\n  - Text:\
