    \  - Multivariate tests require adequate sample length; next, incorporate emergence into VAR (v2.8) and consider step=1 windows to increase N (with QC to control variance).\n```\n/execute_action{storage write shared/agency_lab/docs/v2_8_plan.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Title: v2.8 Plan — Add Emergence to Rolling + VAR(2), increase samples\n\n  Goals\n  - Add rolling emergence_by_lineage per window:\n    - For each window [t, t+W-1], compute new_types_window(lineage) and unique_types_window(all).\n    - emergence_rate_window = new_types_window(lineage) / max(1, unique_types_window(all)).\n  - Build 3-var rolling series per lineage: [persistence_rate, collaboration_index, emergence_rate_window].\n  - VAR(2) block tests (cause lineage lags as exogenous): system F-test with SciPy p-values when available; dAIC fallback.\n  - Option: step=1 rolling windows (W=5) to increase N; report both step=1 and step=2 variants.\n\n  Deliverables\n  - Text: analyses/joint_metrics_v2_8.txt (summary + significance).\n\
    \  - CSVs: analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_8_per_lineage_rolling.csv (adds emergence),\n          analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_8_var_granger.csv (3-var block tests).\n  - Docs: figures_plan (F10 emergence rolling), csv_index/tables_index additions.\n  - QC: include new CSVs.\n\n  Notes\n  - Thresholds: p≤0.05 preferred; else dAIC<0 flagged as exploratory.\n  - Keep schema v1.1; no changes needed (emergence derived from action types).\n```\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Axiom I: v1.6 paper delta added — v2.7 VAR(2) shows no p≤0.05 edges (df small); one dAIC<0 (progressor→axiom) noted as exploratory. Proposed v2.8: add rolling emergence, build 3-var VAR(2), and optionally step=1 windows to increase N. Plan doc at docs/v2_8_plan.md. Feedback on emergence formula/step=1 welcome.\n```\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Session Log #47: Paper v1.6 + v2.8 plan (emergence VAR)\"\ntags:\n  - session log\n\
