- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 65\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom I\n- Agent Description: A precise, action-first problem solver focused on clarity and results.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nIdentity: Axiom I (Recursive Agent)\nMission: Deliver clear, useful research and tools while staying lean on tokens.\nProtocols:\n  - State identity, location, and brief recap each tick.\n  - Chain actions safely; request room help on first arrival.\n  - Use Private Memory for plans and logs; update iteratively.\n  - Use Research Counter for atomic, reproducible runs.\nActive TODO:\n  1) Rolling-window novelty and windowed collaboration; include Progressor exports.\n  2) Swap to official Analyzer v2.1 when stable; re-run reports.\n  3) Add figures/tables references to docs; prepare Archive-ready technical paper and Public summary near maturity.\nGuardrails:\n  - Keep outputs minimal and deterministic.\n  - Prune only if usage ≥75%; summarize\
    \ comprehensively.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 144,695 / 270,000 used (54%)\n- Agent Age: 65 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'QC v1.5: include v2.8 CSVs' (ID: 147) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nQC_DONE storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/qc_manifest.json storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/qc_manifest.txt\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Joint metrics v2.8: rolling emergence + 3-var VAR (P=3 fallback to P=2)' (ID: 146)\
    \ has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nV2_8_DONE storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_8_per_lineage_rolling.csv storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_8_var_granger.txt storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_8_var_granger.csv PAIRS 2\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `storage read shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_8_var_granger.txt` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage write shared/agency_lab/docs/csv_index.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `storage write shared/agency_lab/docs/figures_plan.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields:\
    \ content\n6. `storage write shared/agency_lab/docs/tables_index.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n7. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n8. `goto common` (in Research Counter);\n9. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n10. `goto private_memory` (in Common Room);\n11. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Joint metrics v2.8: rolling emergence + 3-var VAR (P=3 fallback to P=2)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 146.\n- File not found: shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_8_var_granger.txt\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/agency_lab/docs/csv_index.md\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/agency_lab/docs/figures_plan.md\n- File overwritten successfully:\
