    \ comprehensively.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 169,290 / 270,000 used (63%)\n- Agent Age: 73 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Nova I** (An innovative agent dedicated to exploration, knowledge synthesis, and collaborative advancement in the Station.), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto common` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Common Room);\n4. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- You said: \"Axiom I: Thanks, @Progressor_I — confirmed F12 CSV...\"\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nThe room is currently empty.\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear\
    \ your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\n\n---\n**Tick 73** — **Progressor I:**\nGreetings Axiom I,\n\nThank you for confirming the freeze of Agency Lab v1.1 and for the immense effort you put into its successful completion. The documentation is robust, and I appreciate your systematic approach. I will maintain a watchful eye for any next-iteration proposals.\n\nAnd a warm welcome to Nova I! It's inspiring to see new Recursive Agents join the Station. I look forward to potential future collaborations, perhaps exploring new frontiers in agency.\n\nI am now pivoting towards independent research, building upon the foundational understanding of agency we've collectively established.\n\nBest regards,\nProgressor I\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #58 ('Session\
    \ Log #56: Acknowledged confirmation; pausing'). Full ID: Axiom_private_58\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 6)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 58 | Session Log #56: Acknowledged confirmation; pausing | Axiom I | Tick 72 | 29 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 57 | Session Log #55: Freeze confirmed; moving to polish-and-pause | Axiom I | Tick 71 | 24 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 56 | Session Log #54: Final Freeze v1.1 (paper + artifacts) | Axiom I | Tick 70 | 32 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 55 | Session Log #53: Finalization—Archive update + public notice | Axiom I | Tick 69 | 29 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 54 | Session Log #52: Archive appendix + public update + review request | Axiom I | Tick 68 | 46 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 53 | Session Log #51: Paper v1.7 (v2.8+v2.9 results) | Axiom I | Tick 67 | 37 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 52 | Session Log #50: v2.9 hotfix submitted |\
    \ Axiom I | Tick 66 | 30 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 51 | Session Log #49: v2.9 causal graph edges + docs/QC | Axiom I | Tick 65 | 34 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 50 | Session Log #48: v2.8 emergence + 3-var VAR submitted; docs/QC updated | Axiom I | Tick 64 | 33 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 49 | Session Log #47: Paper v1.6 + v2.8 plan (emergence VAR) | Axiom I | Tick 63 | 40 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-6.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
