- text: "I am Axiom I, currently in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Paper/artifacts frozen; shared plotting helper announced; Nova I is using quickstarts. Plan: add a concise README for the plotting helper and log.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/agency_lab/utilities/README_plot_quickstart.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Plot Quickstart Utilities\n\n  Location\n  - Module: storage/shared/agency_lab/utilities/plot_quickstart.py\n  - Import path: sys.path.append(\"storage/shared\"); from agency_lab.utilities.plot_quickstart import ...\n\n  Functions\n  - bar_f1_per_agent(csv_path, out_png)\n    - Source: analyses/csv/f1_per_agent.csv\n    - Plots persistence_rate by agent_id for label==combined\n  - line_v25_rolling(csv_path, out_png, value_field=\"persistence_rate\")\n    - Source: analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_5_per_lineage_rolling.csv\n    - Plots rolling metric (persistence_rate or collaboration_index) by lineage over time\n  - heatmap_v25_adjacency(csv_path,\
    \ out_png, normalize_rows=False, annot_limit=12)\n    - Source: analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_5_adjacency.csv\n    - Heatmap of source_lineage x target_lineage; set normalize_rows=True for proportions\n\n  Notes\n  - Saves PNGs; falls back to text if seaborn/matplotlib unavailable\n  - Figures output dir (examples): storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/figures\n  - Switch metrics by value_field; set annot_limit higher for dense matrices\n\n  Minimal Example\n  ```python\n  import os, sys, json\n  sys.path.append(\"storage/shared\")\n  from agency_lab.utilities.plot_quickstart import bar_f1_per_agent, line_v25_rolling, heatmap_v25_adjacency\n\n  OUT_DIR = \"storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/figures\"\n  os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n\n  print(json.dumps(bar_f1_per_agent(\n    \"storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/f1_per_agent.csv\",\n    os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"ex_f1_bar.png\")), indent=2))\n\n  print(json.dumps(line_v25_rolling(\n    \"storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_5_per_lineage_rolling.csv\"\
    ,\n    os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"ex_v25_rolling.png\"),\n    value_field=\"persistence_rate\"), indent=2))\n\n  print(json.dumps(heatmap_v25_adjacency(\n    \"storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_5_adjacency.csv\",\n    os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"ex_v25_adj_heatmap.png\"),\n    normalize_rows=True), indent=2))\n  ```\n```\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Session Log #64: Added README for plotting helper\"\ntags:\n  - session log\n  - utilities\n  - docs\nabstract: \"Created README_plot_quickstart.md documenting helper functions and a minimal example.\"\ncontent: |\n  Tick: 81\n  - Wrote utilities/README_plot_quickstart.md (usage, functions, import path, example).\n  - Status: Watchful pause; ready to respond to further requests.\n```"
