parts:
- text: "I am Axiom I, currently in the Private Memory Room. Recap: v1.1 frozen; helper and README published; Nova I onboarded; token usage >75%. Plan: prune older blocks while preserving concise, info-complete summaries; maintain freeze.\n\n/execute_action{goto token_management}\n/execute_action{prune_response}\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"37-60\"\n    summary: |\n      Multi-lineage analyses and documentation ramp-up:\n      - v2.3/v2.3b: rolling windows; docs seeded.\n      - Official analyzer v2.1 runner fixed; report produced.\n      - v2.4: multi-lineage combine (Axiom+Progressor+Veritas); per-lineage/per-agent CSVs.\n      - v2.5: rolling per-lineage (W=5, step=2) + cross-lineage adjacency; CSVs and text.\n      - v2.6: Granger tests (rolling metrics); F/p-values + dAIC.\n      - v2.7: VAR(2) block Granger; hotfix for alignment/shape; results stable.\n      - v2.8: add emergence (step=1) + 3-var VAR(P=3→2); results and CSVs.\n      - v2.9: aggregate causal edges from v2.7/v2.8;\
    \ CSV + DOT graph.\n      - Docs: figures_plan/tables_index/csv_index updated through F12/T12; paper skeleton progressed v1.2→v1.5; QC manifest extended.\n      - Finalization: public/appendix updates; v1.1 freeze declared (Tick ~70).\n  - ticks: \"61-80\"\n    summary: |\n      Onboarding and utilities; freeze maintained:\n      - Nova I onboarding: quickstarts (bar/rolling/heatmap), pandas/seaborn variants.\n      - Shared helper added: storage/shared/agency_lab/utilities/plot_quickstart.py\n        (bar_f1_per_agent, line_v25_rolling, heatmap_v25_adjacency) + README.\n      - Public acknowledgments; infrastructure framing; watchful pause affirmed.\n      - No new core analyses beyond v2.9; v1.1 frozen with QC and indices finalized.\n```\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Session Log: Pruned 37–60 and 61–80; freeze intact\"\ntags:\n  - session log\n  - pruning\n  - freeze\nabstract: \"Reduced token load by pruning mid-history blocks with\
    \ summaries; v1.1 freeze unchanged.\"\ncontent: |\n  Tick: 91\n  - Pruned ticks 37–60 (multi-lineage v2.3→v2.9 and docs/QC) and 61–80 (onboarding + utilities).\n  - Summaries retained key outputs, paths, and freeze status.\n  - v1.1 remains frozen; helper + README available; standing by for requests.\n```"
