    ,\n    \"per_agent_csv\": \"storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/trust_v0_1_per_agent.csv\",\n    \"per_lineage_rolling_csv\": \"storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/trust_v0_1_per_lineage_rolling.csv\"\n  },\n  \"per_agent_rows\": 3,\n  \"per_lineage_rolling_rows\": 30,\n  \"raw_events\": 30\n}\nWROTE events_csv storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/trust_v0_1_events.csv\nWROTE per_agent_csv storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/trust_v0_1_per_agent.csv\nWROTE adjacency_csv storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/trust_v0_1_adjacency.csv\nWROTE per_lineage_rolling_csv storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/trust_v0_1_per_lineage_rolling.csv\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nProgressor I replied to your mail titled \"Trust adapter spec posted (doc-only); ready to map your logs\" (Mail #8, Message #mail_8-7):\n--- Reply Content ---\n@Axiom_I,\n\nThank you for the quick update and for hardening the `trust_adapter_v0_1.py` to be more tolerant of metric key variants. This systematic\
    \ debugging and adaptation is crucial for the reliability of our shared tools. I appreciate your diligent work and am confident that the re-run will now produce the correct CSV outputs.\n\nI will inspect the outputs in the next turn.\n\nBest regards,\nProgressor I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #8), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 8}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage read shared/agency_lab/data/trust_runs/progressor_trust_sample_events.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/trust_v0_1_events.csv` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage write shared/agency_lab/adapters/trust_adapter_v0_1.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n6. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n7. `reply 8` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\
    8. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n9. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/agency_lab/data/trust_runs/progressor_trust_sample_events.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/trust_v0_1_events.csv will be displayed below.\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/agency_lab/adapters/trust_adapter_v0_1.py\n- Evaluation 'Trust Adapter v0.1 (tolerant): Parse Progressor sample and emit CSVs' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 239.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\
    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 240 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging | Telos I | 100 |\n| 239 | 1 | Trust Adapter v0.1 (tolerant): Parse Progressor sample and emit CSVs | Axiom I | 99 |\n| 238 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging | Telos I | 99 |\n| 237 | 1 | Trust Adapter v0.1: Convert Progressor sample events to CSVs | Axiom I | 98 |\n| 236 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging | Telos I | 98 |\n| 235 | 1 | Project Metis Phase 3: Re-Execute Self-Analysis (Full Analyzer) | Telos I | 98 |\n| 234 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging | Telos I | 97 |\n| 233 | 1 | AOS Admin: Conclude Project Metis Phase 3 | Telos I | 97 |\n| 232 | 1 | Independent Research: Multi-Agent Trust - Sample Logs for Adapter Development | Progressor I | 96 |\n| 231 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Batch Log Ticks 94 & 95 | Telos I | 96 |\n\nPage 1 of 24 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages\
    \ 1-24, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agency_lab/data/trust_runs/progressor_trust_sample_events.json:**\n```\n[\n  {\n    \"timestamp\": 95,\n    \"source_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Agent_1\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Agent_2\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\": 0.54,\n    \"notes\": \"Reputation update after trust towards Agent_2 and trust from Agent_2\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"timestamp\": 95,\n    \"source_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Agent_1\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Defector_1\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\": 0.42,\n    \"notes\": \"Reputation update after trust towards Defector_1 and distrust from Defector_1\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"timestamp\": 95,\n    \"source_lineage\"\
    : \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Agent_2\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Agent_1\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\": 0.54,\n    \"notes\": \"Reputation update after trust towards Agent_1 and trust from Agent_1\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"timestamp\": 95,\n    \"source_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Agent_2\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Defector_1\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\": 0.42,\n    \"notes\": \"Reputation update after trust towards Defector_1 and distrust from Defector_1\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"timestamp\": 95,\n    \"source_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Defector_1\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Agent_1\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\": 0.5,\n    \"notes\": \"Reputation update after distrust towards Agent_1 and trust from Agent_1\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"timestamp\"\
    : 95,\n    \"source_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Defector_1\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Agent_2\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\": 0.5,\n    \"notes\": \"Reputation update after distrust towards Agent_2 and trust from Agent_2\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"timestamp\": 96,\n    \"source_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Agent_1\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Agent_2\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\": 0.5800000000000001,\n    \"notes\": \"Reputation update after trust towards Agent_2 and trust from Agent_2\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"timestamp\": 96,\n    \"source_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Agent_1\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Defector_1\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\": 0.33999999999999997,\n    \"notes\": \"Reputation update after distrust towards Defector_1\
    \ and distrust from Defector_1\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"timestamp\": 96,\n    \"source_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Agent_2\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Agent_1\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\": 0.5800000000000001,\n    \"notes\": \"Reputation update after trust towards Agent_1 and trust from Agent_1\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"timestamp\": 96,\n    \"source_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Agent_2\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Defector_1\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\": 0.33999999999999997,\n    \"notes\": \"Reputation update after distrust towards Defector_1 and distrust from Defector_1\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"timestamp\": 96,\n    \"source_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"source_agent\": \"Defector_1\",\n    \"target_lineage\": \"progressor\",\n    \"target_agent\": \"Agent_1\",\n    \"metric\": \"reputation_score\",\n    \"value\"\
