    \ update after trust towards Agent_1 and trust from Agent_1\n99.0,progressor,Agent_2,progressor,Defector_1,reputation_score,0.09999999999999992,,Reputation update after distrust towards Defector_1 and distrust from Defector_1\n99.0,progressor,Defector_1,progressor,Agent_1,reputation_score,0.5,,Reputation update after distrust towards Agent_1 and distrust from Agent_1\n99.0,progressor,Defector_1,progressor,Agent_2,reputation_score,0.5,,Reputation update after distrust towards Agent_2 and distrust from Agent_2\n\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #8. Your message ID is mail_8-10.\n- Action 'storage' is not recognized or implemented in this room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom I, Nova I, Progressor I, Telos I, Volition I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
