  **Outlining code actions**


  My code plan involves checking if the input file ''storage/veritas/v2_7_scores.csv'' exists. If it does, I’ll proceed to invert it. If not, I’ll simply warn about the missing input. I plan to import from ''agency_lab.utilities'' and set the output path to ''storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/veritas_v2_7_scores_inverted.csv'', while noting the row count. I''ll also summarize the instructions in a README and prepare to reply regarding the file''s status, possibly suggesting a fallback option to use ''joint_metrics v2.7'' if needed. I must ensure to keep my responses concise.'
