    \ 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_6: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_7: 1.00\n  Agent_5 (Gen 5): Total Reward = 81535.71428571442\n    Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.33\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_6: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_7: 1.00\n  Agent_6 (Gen 5): Total Reward = 81535.71428571442\n    Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.33\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_7: 1.00\n  Agent_7 (Gen 5): Total Reward = 81535.71428571442\n    Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.32\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_6: 1.00\n  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\n    - roof_panel_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    - door_frame_1: Crafted Ready=True,\
    \ Assembled=True\n  Completed Components (Global History):\n    - foundation_2: Assembled=True\n    - foundation_1: Assembled=True\n    - wall_segment_1: Assembled=True\n    - wall_segment_2: Assembled=True\n    - roof_panel_1: Assembled=True\n    - door_frame_1: Assembled=True\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases\
