    \ Assembled=True\n  Completed Components (Global History):\n    - foundation_2: Assembled=True\n    - foundation_1: Assembled=True\n    - wall_segment_1: Assembled=True\n    - wall_segment_2: Assembled=True\n    - roof_panel_1: Assembled=True\n    - door_frame_1: Assembled=True\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases\
