    \ Collective Reward: 3000.0, Epsilon_A1: 0.09, Epsilon_A3: 0.07):\n  Agent_1 (Gen 6): Total Reward = 110550.0\n    Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.30\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n  Agent_2 (Gen 6): Total Reward = 110550.0\n    Specialization: Most=gather_metal, Index=0.29\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n  Agent_3 (Gen 6): Total Reward = 110550.0\n    Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.30\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n  Agent_4 (Gen 6): Total Reward = 110550.0\n    Specialization: Most=gather_metal, Index=0.30\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n  Agent_5 (Gen 6): Total Reward = 110550.0\n    Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.29\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n\
